/E (The in-industry alternative is the best choice for Beyond Meat currently as it takes into account brand awareness and long-term acceptance and growth potential. The in-industry strategy lets Beyond Meat grow within its current market while also reaching out to a younger, more responsive audience, like college students and young professionals. This is different from the status quo, which limits the company to its current marketing approach and a small group of customers.)
