/Title (This alternative has moderate but manageable costs regarding rebranding, partnerships, and product development. The target includes young adults, students, and flexitarians; it addresses the weakness in the market reach of Beyond Meat. Campus programs, taste tests, and fast-food partnerships boost visibility. Rebranding to Beyond Bite might be some confusion in the short term, however, it has long-term growth. While moderately complex, coordination with a large number of partners allows for greater differentiation, with fewer competitors operating in both retail and fast-food channels.)
