1398 0 obj
<<
/Title (Beyond Meat maintains a heavy emphasis on research and development \(R&D\) as well as marketing investments aimed at changing consumer perceptions and normalizing plant-based meat consumption. They will aim for acceptance of plant-based protein as a regular dietary choice, rather than a complement. While this strategy has helped the company establish strong brand recognition, it also keeps Beyond Meat operating within the same category and consumer mindset.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1380 0 R
/Prev 1397 0 R
>>
endobj
