/Title (While this alternative has minimal implementation complexity and keeps a strong brand image, it does not have advantage in its profitability and market reach criteria. Thus, continuing the current strategy would maintain stability but limited long-term growth and  acceptance, which could lead to risk of survival in the industry in the long-run.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
